  "name": "Question 10",
  "problem": "Translate the following phrase into an algebraic expression: \"The quotient of twenty and a number.\"\n\nUse the letter $h$ to represent the unknown number.\n\n{{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "If we denote our number by $h,$ we can write \"the quotient of twenty and a number\" as $\\frac{20}{h}.$",
